<description>&lt;p&gt;The insurgency in southern Thailand now overlaps with heightened Thai‑Cambodian border tensions, as Cambodia and Thailand discuss incremental peace steps while disputing territory claims. Environmental pressure has grown as poison flowing from Burma into the Chiang Rai river basin intensifies calls for Thai action. Thailand is also tightening scrutiny of recycling licences in Prachin Buri and advancing a large‑scale power‑grid project linking it with Malaysia, Myanmar and Singapore. A high‑profile repatriation saw a Filipina trafficking victim with stage‑4 cancer returned safely from Thailand. The conflict caused 35 battle‑related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/08/us-aircraft-carrier-abraham-lincoln-returns-to-san-diego-after-record-deployment&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOTVduc1I0SVZVMUpFT0VhQ01jQjBEM3g4M2dWODZjTy1rWklVdHNpSUppVC0yajlkU09ZTEI4SGo0N2s5dk8taFNXT20wbk9jWVpGQlVMVDZiS0k0WlhiODlDWHdnOWR4SlZNcmZTclBBS2RfMC1EUVcyY0NralhaSg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/09/us-sailors-reunite-with-families-as-uss-abraham-lincoln-returns-home&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOZ1Q3MVprTUtNaDB3bEdGQ01MZ2UtaXI3OEl4RFZya1Z6OXhwczB5QmRQNnZHQVI4OUswZExyUUVHX2gyWFBIbWdEZzdtU2Rvak96Z0YzajZsdFJjTmdWcjJwamQzNmRGSTVGdnBzeC16MDBwcHFCbW82Y0tFdU5IcXpQeDNyYllOTDhzUFJzMzNFUENyYnE5UXo2MUFIMVg2NlF0VU13?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNRDExVW05SWsxeTFTaGppUjdQSnhOVXh4VEZBSmNzMWtuY2JWcWtPQWNVY0podi1xbE9xT0p2TWtmQ002QTBRVGhIaVN0ZXM0T2tPUWZ5Q2h6dTA1ZW5FNGFucWNGNm5aSGZabHdkYXBOYUIxNk54bEpyd0x6eE9YcVdzV3VuSkpFY1FXb20ydEl5QU